<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HOW — three steps, because it is genuinely three steps.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="band">
  <div class="lp-wrap">
    <div class="band-head rv">
      <span class="eyebrow">Three minutes to set up</span>
      <h2>Then you never open it again.</h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="rv">
        <span class="step-n">01</span>
        <h3>Say what you want</h3>
        <p>Keywords and a country. <em>"intern"</em> in Sri Lanka. It also knows
          that <em>trainee</em> means the same thing.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rv d1">
        <span class="step-n">02</span>
        <h3>It watches, you don't</h3>
        <p>Every few minutes it checks all four boards for postings it has never
          seen. No feed to scroll, no tab to leave open, no laptop running.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="rv d2">
        <span class="step-n">03</span>
        <h3>It interrupts you only when it matters</h3>
        <p>One email per sweep, every new role, a direct apply link. Nothing new
          means silence — which is the point.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     HONESTY — the section that makes the rest believable.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="band honest-band">
  <div class="lp-wrap honest rv">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The part most tools won't tell you</span>
      <h2>We say <em>minutes</em>, not <em>instantly</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        LinkedIn does not put a job into its search index the moment it is
        published — that takes tens of minutes, and nothing can poll its way past
        it. Anyone promising instant alerts is guessing.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">
        What you get is the rest of the hour. Applicant number nine instead of
        number two hundred. That gap is the entire product, and it is enough.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="figs">
      <div class="fig"><span class="fig-n tnum" data-count="5" data-prefix="&lt;">0<small>min</small></span>
        <span class="fig-k">Our part of the delay</span></div>
      <div class="fig"><span class="fig-n tnum">24/7</span>
        <span class="fig-k">Runs while you sleep</span></div>
      <div class="fig"><span class="fig-n tnum" data-count="0">0</span>
        <span class="fig-k">Feeds to check</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


